<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_cbed980053d149349ef9ddc5219c97148442615cb0a07dfe6cb4571bf22fad4e_n0008/tu_0006> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "• Oral magnesium salts • In severe cases [magnesium <1.25 mg/dL (<0.5 mmol/L)] and life-threatening arrhythmia: magnesium sulfate 1–2 g i.v. over 30–60 s and repeat in 5–15 min if necessary • In asymptomatic patients and magnesium <1.25 mg/dL (<0.5 mmol/L): magnesium sulfate 1–2 g/h i.v. for up to 10 h" .
